.TH KERNOVA-WELCOME 1 "November 2026" "KERNOVA OS"
.SH NAME
kernova-welcome \- open the KERNOVA desktop introduction
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kernova-welcome
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the offline introduction, desktop shortcuts, system information and
local help. Run it as the logged-in desktop user. The application contains
a per-user preference for launching it when a Plasma session starts.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/share/doc/kernova-welcome/user-guide.md
.RS
Local desktop and recovery guide.
.RE
